 and hire a security guard to chase down the thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.poster.avif?t=1755241956\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.webm?t=1755241956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.mp4?t=1755241956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
